components.description:
Thin wrapper that bridges InstrumentOrchestrator (high-frequency event stream)
 into React 18+ via useSyncExternalStore. All coordination logic lives in the orchestrator.

 @param isActive - Whether detection should be active (camera runs only when true and mounted)
 @param initialInstruments - Initial instrument state
 @param sessionKey - Unique key per tray/assembly session
 @param containerWidth - Container width for smoothing threshold (default from DETECTION_DEFAULTS)
 @param configOverrides - Optional overrides for scoreThreshold, greenConfidenceThreshold, etc.
 @param onPersistIncrement - Called when instrument leaves camera (GREEN) with auto-increment - for backend persistence
 @param sourceIndex - Index into video-sources list. Temporary - remove when handshake is replaced by real stream.
 @param inputMode - 'video' (file sources) or 'camera' (live). Default: video.
 @returns Detection state and stable action callbacks (UseInstrumentLifecycleResult)

